{"publicId":"672f1504-f7ec-4083-8eba-97af51563a60","title":"Nvidia董事会调查CEO领导问题及婚外情指控致股价下跌","status":"active","reportCount":1,"sourceCount":1,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:25:11.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-11T22:25:11.000Z","digest":"Nvidia董事会于2026年11月10日启动对CEO Jensen Huang的领导力调查，市场对其辞职概率定价从12%升至13.5%，随后因婚外情指控股价在盘后交易中下跌4.5%至31%.\n\n该调查与外国情报机构针对Huang的潜在威胁相关，且公司目前缺乏明确继任者，导致治理稳定性受质疑。新指控虽未获官方回应，但公司此前已否认类似间谍指控。\n\n市场数据显示，11月10日调查启动后辞职概率从12%升至13.5%，11月12日因婚外情指控股价下跌后升至31%。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T22:42:08.146Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"NVIDIA股价因CEO Jensen Huang 新的婚外情指控下跌4.5%","latestReport":{"id":"bdhcm8l9i1azkfqxq1cg1bq3v"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":1,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":1,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"fjrqIY9L3fhY","title":"Nvidia股价下跌4.5%","firstReportAt":"2026-11-11T22:25:11.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"bdhcm8l9i1azkfqxq1cg1bq3v","title":"NVIDIA股价因CEO Jensen Huang 新的婚外情指控下跌4.5%","summary":"NVIDIA股价因CEO Jensen Huang 新的婚外情指控在盘后交易中下跌4.5%。董事会已介入调查，市场对其去职概率从16%升至31%。公司未回应指控，但此前已否认类似间谍指控。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:25:11.000Z","selected":false}}],"officialReports":[],"timeline":[{"id":"bdhcm8l9i1azkfqxq1cg1bq3v","title":"NVIDIA股价因CEO Jensen Huang 新的婚外情指控下跌4.5%","summary":"NVIDIA股价因CEO Jensen Huang 新的婚外情指控在盘后交易中下跌4.5%。董事会已介入调查，市场对其去职概率从16%升至31%。公司未回应指控，但此前已否认类似间谍指控。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-11T22:25:11.000Z","selected":false}],"heat":[{"hour":"2026-11-11T05:00:00.000Z","heat":6.7,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T06:00:00.000Z","heat":6.5,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T07:00:00.000Z","heat":6.3,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T08:00:00.000Z","heat":6.1,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T09:00:00.000Z","heat":5.9,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T10:00:00.000Z","heat":5.8,"participants":1},{"hour":"2026-11-11T11:00:00.000Z","heat":5.6,"participants":